SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261013
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261014
SUMMARY:W03: 25 min easy + 4 × 20 sec strides
DESCRIPTION:25 minutes easy\, then 4 repeats of 20 seconds smooth\, relaxed
  acceleration and 80 seconds walking or very easy jogging. Include recover
 y after the final repeat\, then 5 minutes easy. Total 36.6667 minutes. Eac
 h stride: build speed gradually\, briefly run quick and relaxed\, then eas
 e down\; never an all-out sprint. If 80 seconds is insufficient\, extend r
 ecovery. Use a flat\, clear surface.\nIf not recovered\, replace this with
  an easy run or rest. Do not stack a separate Nike workout on top.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
