BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hm20270314-20261215@personal-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260928T000000Z
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:W12: 30 min easy + 6 × 20 sec strides
DESCRIPTION:30 minutes easy\, then 6 repeats of 20 seconds smooth\, relaxed
  acceleration and 80 seconds walking or very easy jogging. Include recover
 y after the final repeat\, then 5 minutes easy. Total 45 minutes. Each str
 ide: build speed gradually\, briefly run quick and relaxed\, then ease dow
 n\; never an all-out sprint. If 80 seconds is insufficient\, extend recove
 ry. Use a flat\, clear surface.\nIf not recovered\, replace this with an e
 asy run or rest. Do not stack a separate Nike workout on top.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
